 :rate-limits [
  "App-level (platform) limit: 'Calls within one hour = 200 * Number of Users' (DAU-based, rolling 1h), counted per app across all calls made with app access tokens; usage exposed via X-App-Usage header; error code 4 on breach — https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting"
  "User-level limit: rolling 1h call count per user, value not disclosed for privacy, spread across apps; error code 17 — https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting"
  "Pages Business-Use-Case (BUC) limit (page or system-user tokens): 'Calls within 24 hours = 4800 * Number of Engaged Users' (users who engaged with the Page per 24h), counted against the app's call count in a rolling 24h window; Pages API calls made with app/user tokens instead follow platform logic; error 32 '(#32)…"
  "Ads Insights BUC: Standard Access apps 'Calls within one hour = 600 + 400 * Number of Active ads − 0.001 * User Errors'; Advanced Access apps '190000 + 400 * Number of Active ads − 0.001 * User Errors' — https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting"
  "Ads Management BUC: Standard 'Calls within one hour = 300 + 40 * Number of Active ads'; Advanced '100000 + 40 * Number of Active ads' (per ad account, quota shared across endpoints of the same business use case; X-Business-Use-Case-Usage header, estimated_time_to_regain_access) —…"
  "Marketing API score-based ad-account limits: read call = 1 point, write = 3 points; Limited/dev tier max score 60 with 300s decay and 300s block on breach; Full tier max score 9000, 60s block; errors 17/613 (subcodes 2446079, 1487742); Marketing API calls are excluded from Graph API throttling —…"
  "Marketing API mutation burst limit: 100 QPS per app+ad-account on create/edit of campaigns, ad sets, ads (POST /{ad-account}/campaigns|adsets|ads etc.); error 613 subcode 5044001 — https://developers.facebook.com/documentation/ads-commerce/marketing-api/overview/rate-limiting"
  "Dormancy: Meta 'may suspend or end your App's access to any Platform APIs, permissions, or features that your App has not used or accessed within a 28-day period' — https://developers.facebook.com/terms"
  "Throttle best practice: stop calls on breach, spread traffic, check X-App-Usage / X-Business-Use-Case-Usage; use system-user tokens for Page Public Content Access polling — https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/overview/rate-limiting"
 ]
