  :collectable-without-own-presence "Without your own LINE Official Account (and without any registered provider/channel), a business can collect essentially NOTHING about LINE users through official channels: every data surface (webhooks, Messaging API profiles/audiences/insights, OA Manager stats, LIFF) is gated behind a channel you own, and LINE IDs are per-provider, so another provider's data is not transferable or linkable. If you skip the OA but still register a provider + LINE Login channel (free; no OA required), you may collect per consenting logged-in user: sub/userId (openid scope), displayName, pictureUrl, statusMessage (profile scope), and email only after LINE approves the console application; phone/address/gender/birthday only via the LINE Profile+ corporate agreement. LIFF apps can also run on a LINE Login channel for the same fields. Ad-side analytics (LINE Ads API / Conversion API) need an approved corporate LINE Ads/Business Manager account rather than an OA. LINE Notify was fully discontinued on 2025-03-31 (April 1, 2025 onward all its APIs unavailable), removing the last free push path. Scraping public LINE/OA pages to reconstruct user data is barred by the LY Terms of Use reuse/collection prohibitions. https://developers.line.biz/en/docs/line-login/getting-started/ , https://developers.line.biz/en/docs/messaging-api/getting-started/ ,…"
